          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 104384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a lavorare con i <strong>template literal</strong> di JavaScript, che rendono semplice aggiungere variabili ed espressioni all'interno delle stringhe.</p><p>Guarda qui sotto come i template literal ottengono lo stesso risultato del metodo più lungo sopra.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen McGuire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + fullName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Hello \" /><text value=\"${fullName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hello Helen McGuire!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello Helen McGuire!\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Literal string",
            "id": 104385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I template literal semplificano la combinazione di stringhe e variabili tramite stringhe letterali.</p><p>Trasforma la stringa <code>\"Apple\"</code> in un valore letterale stringa racchiudendo <code>Apple</code> tra caratteri backtick anziché tra virgolette doppie.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>`</code>, seguito da <code>Apple</code> e infine <code>`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I template literal semplificano la combinazione di stringhe e variabili tramite stringhe letterali.</p><p>Trasforma la stringa <code>\"Apple\"</code> in un valore letterale stringa racchiudendo <code>Apple</code> tra caratteri backtick anziché tra virgolette doppie.</p><p>Memorizza <code>Apple</code> in un template literal, così il valore potrà includere un'espressione in seguito.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Apple&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Apple'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Cake\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>cake</code> e infine <code>Apple</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Variables",
            "id": 104386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per combinare facilmente le variabili con i valori letterali stringa, usiamo la sintassi <code>${name}</code>, dove <code>name</code> è una variabile.</p><p>Codice <code>${category}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" category = \" /><text value=\"`pie`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple \" /><text value=\"${category}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple pie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>$</code>, seguito da <code>{</code> e poi <code>category</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per combinare facilmente le variabili con i valori letterali stringa, usiamo la sintassi <code>${name}</code>, dove <code>name</code> è una variabile.</p><p>Codice <code>${category}</code>.</p><p>Fai in modo che la console visualizzi <code>Apple pie</code> inserendo il valore di <code>category</code> dopo Apple.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" category = \" /><text value=\"`pie`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple \" /><text value=\"${category}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"$[category]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"${category}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"`${category}`\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple pie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>cake</code>, seguito da <code>$</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>category</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Expressions",
            "id": 104387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi anche eseguire operazioni all'interno di una stringa letterale aggiungendo espressioni tra le parentesi graffe di <code>${}</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi l'espressione <code>quantity * price</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cost = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost : \" /><text value=\"${quantity * price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost : 200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>quantity</code>, seguito da <code>*</code> e infine <code>price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi anche eseguire operazioni all'interno di una stringa letterale aggiungendo espressioni tra le parentesi graffe di <code>${}</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi l'espressione <code>quantity * price</code>.</p><p>Fai in modo che il template visualizzato mostri <code>Total cost : 200</code> calcolando al suo interno la quantità per il prezzo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cost = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost : \" /><text value=\"${quantity * price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost : 200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>$</code>, seguito da <code>{</code>, <code>quantity</code>, <code>*</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Functions",
            "id": 104388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando chiami una funzione, ometti le parentesi <code>()</code> se passi una stringa letterale come argomento alla funzione.</p><p>Passiamo la stringa letterale <code>Jane</code> quando chiamiamo la funzione <code>greetings</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Bonjour \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greetings\" /><text value=\"`Jane`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(Jane)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bonjour Jane!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>`Jane`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando chiami una funzione, ometti le parentesi <code>()</code> se passi una stringa letterale come argomento alla funzione.</p><p>Passiamo la stringa letterale <code>Jane</code> quando chiamiamo la funzione <code>greetings</code>.</p><p>Usa la chiamata di funzione con tag che visualizza <code>Bonjour Jane!</code> senza inserire parentesi prima del template literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Bonjour \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greetings\" /><text value=\"`Jane`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetings(`Jane`)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bonjour Jane!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>greetings</code>, seguito da <code>`Jane`</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Literal string",
            "id": 105017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come trasformiamo una stringa in un letterale stringa?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Racchiudendo la stringa tra caratteri backtick</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Racchiudendo la stringa tra virgolette doppie</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Racchiudendo la stringa tra caratteri backtick.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In seguito vuoi inserire una variabile nel testo. Quali delimitatori devono racchiudere ora il testo iniziale?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I backtick, per creare un template literal.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le virgolette doppie, per creare un template literal.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Le parentesi, per creare un template literal.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I backtick, per creare un template literal.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Variables",
            "id": 105018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va nel codice seguente, che dovrebbe visualizzare <code>June Jenny</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastName = \" /><text value=\"`Jenny`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"`June $[lastName]`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fullName);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"June $[lastName]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dovremmo usare le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> invece delle parentesi quadre <code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dovremmo usare le parentesi tonde <code>()</code> invece delle parentesi quadre <code>[]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dovremmo usare le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> invece delle parentesi quadre <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'output contiene i caratteri <code>$[lastName]</code> invece di Jenny. Quale modifica fa valutare a JavaScript la variabile memorizzata?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastName = \" /><text value=\"`Jenny`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"`June $[lastName]`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fullName);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"June $[lastName]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sostituire le parentesi quadre con parentesi graffe.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sostituire le parentesi quadre con parentesi tonde.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovere il simbolo del dollaro.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sostituire le parentesi quadre con parentesi graffe.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Expressions",
            "id": 105019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si combinano le espressioni con le stringhe letterali?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungiamo espressioni all'interno delle parentesi graffe della sintassi <code>${}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungiamo espressioni dopo le parentesi graffe della sintassi <code>${}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungiamo espressioni all'interno delle parentesi graffe della sintassi <code>${}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>`Total: ${price * quantity}`</code>, dove va inserita la moltiplicazione affinché il risultato appaia nel testo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">All'interno delle parentesi graffe dopo <code>$</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dopo la parentesi graffa di chiusura, fuori dal template.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">All'interno di parentesi tonde invece che graffe.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">All'interno delle parentesi graffe dopo <code>$</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Functions",
            "id": 105020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa omettiamo quando chiamiamo una funzione con un argomento stringa letterale?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le parentesi <code>()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I caratteri backtick</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le parentesi <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un tag di template è seguito immediatamente da un template literal. Quale punteggiatura è assente prima del backtick?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le parentesi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I backtick.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il simbolo del dollaro.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le parentesi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Literal string",
            "id": 105022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Includi il titolo del film <code>Brave</code> come stringa letterale.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie = \" /><text value=\"`Brave`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(movie);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"´Brave´\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brave\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>`Brave`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza <code>Brave</code> in una costante chiamata <code>movie</code>, usando un template literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"movie\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Brave`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"movie\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"film\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Brave&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Brave'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brave\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>movie</code> e infine <code>`Brave`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 105023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il secondo valore stringa per combinare i due in uno solo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" old = \" /><text value=\"`Superman`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" latest = \" /><text value=\"`Startrek`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${old}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"${latest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(movies);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Superman, Startrek\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>${latest}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Expressions",
            "id": 105024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il codice per calcolare il costo totale dei biglietti del cinema.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticketPrice = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" persons = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost: \" /><text value=\"${ticketPrice * persons}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost: 2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>$</code>, seguito da <code>{</code> e poi <code>*</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi valutare espressioni all'interno di un template literal inserendole tra <code>${</code> e <code>}</code>.</p><p>Fai in modo che il template visualizzi <code>Total cost: 2500</code> moltiplicando al suo interno il prezzo del biglietto per il numero di persone.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticketPrice = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" persons = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost: \" /><text value=\"${ticketPrice * persons}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost: 2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>$</code>, seguito da <code>{</code>, <code>ticketPrice</code>, <code>*</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
