            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione <code>likedBy</code> e passa l'argomento letterale stringa <code>Hellen</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likedBy = \" /><text value=\"person\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Movie liked by: \" /><text value=\"${person}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likedBy\" /><text value=\"`Hellen`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;Hellen&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Movie liked by: Hellen\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>likedBy</code>, seguito da <code>`Hellen`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per questa chiamata con un template literal, inserisci la stringa tra backtick subito dopo il nome della funzione, senza parentesi.</p><p>Usa quella forma di chiamata e il parametro nel testo restituito per visualizzare <code>Movie liked by: Hellen</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likedBy = \" /><text value=\"person\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Movie liked by: \" /><text value=\"${person}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likedBy\" /><text value=\"`Hellen`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetings\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Hellen&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;person&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Movie liked by: Hellen\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>person</code>, seguito da <code>likedBy</code> e infine <code>`Hellen`</code>.</p></body></html>",
